# Team Summary — <%= it.team.quarter.label %>

**Manager:** <%= it.team.manager %>  ·  **Period:** <%= it.team.quarter.from %> → <%= it.team.quarter.to %>

## The quarter in numbers

- **<%= it.team.totals.prsMerged %>** <%= it.fmt.plural(it.team.totals.prsMerged, "PR") %> merged by the team
- **<%= it.team.totals.reviewsGiven %>** code <%= it.fmt.plural(it.team.totals.reviewsGiven, "review") %> given
- **<%= it.team.totals.reposTouched %>** <%= it.fmt.plural(it.team.totals.reposTouched, "service") %> touched
- **<%= it.team.totals.issuesClosed %>** linked <%= it.fmt.plural(it.team.totals.issuesClosed, "issue") %> closed

## Highlights by person
<% it.team.members.forEach(function(m){ %>
### <%= m.displayName %>

- <%= m.prsMerged %> <%= it.fmt.plural(m.prsMerged, "PR") %> merged (<%= m.prsByKind.feature %> <%= it.fmt.plural(m.prsByKind.feature, "feature") %>, <%= m.prsByKind.bugfix %> <%= it.fmt.plural(m.prsByKind.bugfix, "fix", "fixes") %>), <%= m.reviewsGiven %> <%= it.fmt.plural(m.reviewsGiven, "review") %> given
<% if (m.topPRs.length > 0) { -%>
- Top PR: [<%= m.topPRs[0].title %>](<%= m.topPRs[0].url %>) (`<%= m.topPRs[0].repo %>#<%= m.topPRs[0].number %>`)
<% } -%>
<% if (m.shippedMilestones.length > 0) { -%>
- Milestones: <%= m.shippedMilestones.join(", ") %>
<% } -%>
<% }); -%>
<% if (it.team.dataGaps.length > 0) { %>
## Data gaps

_The following repositories couldn't be fully scanned. Numbers above exclude them._

<% it.team.dataGaps.forEach(function(g){ -%>
- `<%= g.repo %>`: <%= g.reason %>
<% }); -%>
<% } -%>

---

_Generated by shipreport v<%= it.version %> on <%= it.generatedAt %>._
